Copyright 2026 KDNA Authors

This product includes software developed at
https://github.com/aikdna/kdna-core-swift

kdna-core-swift provides native Core admission and public Read for `.kdna`
judgment assets on macOS and iOS. Read requires the embedding's explicit
trusted control and Host providers; technical admission grants no action
authority.

See LICENSE for the full Apache 2.0 license text. See README.md for the
current Swift Core/Read guide and supported API surface.
